(2270137, 313018, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful entry!  Love the golden softness.  A picture to be proud of.</td>', 'Beautiful entry!  Love the golden softness.  A picture to be proud of.', '2006-03-29 13:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270142, 312213, 3102, '<td valign="top">Good timing!  I would have cropped it to eliminate as much of the clutter (not to call kids "clutter") in the background.  Maybe a vertical crop just showing the girl with the ball, and the girl beside her?  The rest of the girls/crowd in the shot are really unnecessary here.</td>', 'Good timing!  I would have cropped it to eliminate as much of the clutter (not to call kids "clutter") in the background.  Maybe a vertical crop just showing the girl with the ball, and the girl beside her?  The rest of the girls/crowd in the shot are really unnecessary here.', '2006-03-29 13:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270144, 313346, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - all that black is good.  Would make a good poster.  Since it''s such a lovely image I feel free to point out two little distractions: the shadow on the guy in back and the blue reflection to the right of the hand.</td>', 'Beautiful image - all that black is good.  Would make a good poster.  Since it''s such a lovely image I feel free to point out two little distractions: the shadow on the guy in back and the blue reflection to the right of the hand.', '2006-03-29 13:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
