(2271108, 311750, 44878, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you were trying to catch some Motion Blur, I think a faster shutter speed may have done you better as the Fella across the road is a bit blurred too.<br/>Maybe you could have clonned him out.<br/>Top marks to the cyclist though</td>', 'Not sure if you were trying to catch some Motion Blur, I think a faster shutter speed may have done you better as the Fella across the road is a bit blurred too.Maybe you could have clonned him out.Top marks to the cyclist though', '2006-03-29 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
