(2271320, 312369, 36065, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I would not have gotten this one.  However, once reading your caption, I think that this one hits the challenge very well.  I like the composition and the lighting, but the focus looks to be off just a bit.  Nice capture, though.</td>', 'Without the title, I would not have gotten this one.  However, once reading your caption, I think that this one hits the challenge very well.  I like the composition and the lighting, but the focus looks to be off just a bit.  Nice capture, though.', '2006-03-29 19:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
