(2271421, 312053, 41522, '<td valign="top">A really fun shot, composed nicely.  Not sure if was the conversion to B&amp;W or the original shot, but there are a few hot spots, especially on the children''s faces.</td>', 'A really fun shot, composed nicely.  Not sure if was the conversion to B&W or the original shot, but there are a few hot spots, especially on the children''s faces.', '2006-03-29 19:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
