(2271440, 310052, 41522, '<td valign="top">A cute shot and I like the poses a lot.  If I may suggest some things for improvement .... the Power Ranger''s hand and foot are chopped off of the photo and that usually is a big no no (because it tends to move the viewer''s eyes outside of the photo).  Also, a less distracting bakground, by using a shallow DOF, would have put more visual weight on your subject.  JMO.</td>', 'A cute shot and I like the poses a lot.  If I may suggest some things for improvement .... the Power Ranger''s hand and foot are chopped off of the photo and that usually is a big no no (because it tends to move the viewer''s eyes outside of the photo).  Also, a less distracting bakground, by using a shallow DOF, would have put more visual weight on your subject.  JMO.', '2006-03-29 19:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
