(2273026, 312297, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot but a bit too tight in the frame. Of course, I know with action sports photogrpahy you often have to take the best of what you''ve got.</td>', 'Nice action shot but a bit too tight in the frame. Of course, I know with action sports photogrpahy you often have to take the best of what you''ve got.', '2006-03-30 10:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273027, 312356, 16402, '<td valign="top">OK, since this was obviously set up on a seamless background I don''t understand the decision not to have hippo completely in the frame. Otherwise, technically a very nice shot.</td>', 'OK, since this was obviously set up on a seamless background I don''t understand the decision not to have hippo completely in the frame. Otherwise, technically a very nice shot.', '2006-03-30 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
