(2273041, 312827, 16402, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field, composition and subject matter.</td>', 'Great depth of field, composition and subject matter.', '2006-03-30 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273042, 310919, 16402, '<td valign="top">Two blue posts in  back are distracting elements. Otherwise pretty nice job.</td>', 'Two blue posts in  back are distracting elements. Otherwise pretty nice job.', '2006-03-30 10:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273074, 312435, 48298, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I didn''t know that color-selection was allowed under Basic Editing?  I thought you could go to B&amp;W, but it had to be the whole image?  Maybe I''m wrong.  Cute composition and cute kid, though.<br/> <br/>Edit:  I bumped you up 3 points, after reading your PM and realizing that this was an in-camera setting.  Good luck!  It''s adorable.</td>', 'I like this, but I didn''t know that color-selection was allowed under Basic Editing?  I thought you could go to B&W, but it had to be the whole image?  Maybe I''m wrong.  Cute composition and cute kid, though. Edit:  I bumped you up 3 points, after reading your PM and realizing that this was an in-camera setting.  Good luck!  It''s adorable.', '2006-03-30 10:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273083, 313187, 9643, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of including animal playtime in this challenge and this is a good capture of the dogs playing.  I''m sure it took patience to get this shot.</td>', 'I love the idea of including animal playtime in this challenge and this is a good capture of the dogs playing.  I''m sure it took patience to get this shot.', '2006-03-30 11:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273090, 310799, 9643, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the clarity of this shot and the expressions on the faces of the two gentlemen in it.  What a capture of the split second action! Your title renders it appropriate to the theme as well.  Nice job.</td>', 'I enjoy the clarity of this shot and the expressions on the faces of the two gentlemen in it.  What a capture of the split second action! Your title renders it appropriate to the theme as well.  Nice job.', '2006-03-30 11:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273102, 313089, 9643, '<td valign="top">Even though I do not share your sense of humor and I would normally pass on a photo of this nature, I have to admit that it is clever and well executed.</td>', 'Even though I do not share your sense of humor and I would normally pass on a photo of this nature, I have to admit that it is clever and well executed.', '2006-03-30 11:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273109, 313096, 9643, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of photo that I personally enjoy.  I love the expression of the face of the cap stealer and the hint of a smile on the cheek of the victim.  The placement of their feet suggests the stop action that I appreciate in photography.</td>', 'This is the kind of photo that I personally enjoy.  I love the expression of the face of the cap stealer and the hint of a smile on the cheek of the victim.  The placement of their feet suggests the stop action that I appreciate in photography.', '2006-03-30 11:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273122, 313283, 9643, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific shot.  The composition and colors are pleasing and attractive.  I do not care for the border.  For me the contrasting orange of the frame compromises instead of compliments the wonderful blue of the lake and the sky.</td>', 'This is a terrific shot.  The composition and colors are pleasing and attractive.  I do not care for the border.  For me the contrasting orange of the frame compromises instead of compliments the wonderful blue of the lake and the sky.', '2006-03-30 11:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2273136, 312868, 9643, '<td valign="top">What an enjoyable picture!  Children are my favorite topic and my favorite thing to photograph. This is a wonderful capture of children''s joy in playing.  The best in the competition so far.</td>', 'What an enjoyable picture!  Children are my favorite topic and my favorite thing to photograph. This is a wonderful capture of children''s joy in playing.  The best in the competition so far.', '2006-03-30 11:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
