(2278909, 310023, 8860, '<td valign="top">Skewed horizontal plane here, but an interesting twist on the challenge theme.</td>', 'Skewed horizontal plane here, but an interesting twist on the challenge theme.', '2006-04-01 19:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2278918, 311400, 8860, '<td valign="top">I wanted to shoot some grown-up playtime but didn''t do anything grown-up this week! (No, not even THAT.)<br/>; )<br/> <br/>This documents playtime OK, but it lacks that wow factor or key focal point to really make it anything more interesting than a snapshot.</td>', 'I wanted to shoot some grown-up playtime but didn''t do anything grown-up this week! (No, not even THAT.); ) This documents playtime OK, but it lacks that wow factor or key focal point to really make it anything more interesting than a snapshot.', '2006-04-01 19:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279004, 311584, 49773, '<td valign="top">Good details for so low light I assume..</td>', 'Good details for so low light I assume..', '2006-04-01 20:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279010, 313113, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool shot.  A good moment, and great expressions on the kids faces.  Technically, I believe this photo has good points and room for improvement.  The exposure/processing is spot on.  From dark background to the white pulled out pockets, the exposure seems very good.  The contrast of the photo is extremely good!  As for improvements, I really would like a little sharper focus on the kids.  Perhaps you used a shutter speed that was a bit slow?  Maybe a tripod with a ball head if possible?  Either was, the focus of the 2 boys is just a bit soft for my liking.  JMO.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool shot.  A good moment, and great expressions on the kids faces.  Technically, I believe this photo has good points and room for improvement.  The exposure/processing is spot on.  From dark background to the white pulled out pockets, the exposure seems very good.  The contrast of the photo is extremely good!  As for improvements, I really would like a little sharper focus on the kids.  Perhaps you used a shutter speed that was a bit slow?  Maybe a tripod with a ball head if possible?  Either was, the focus of the 2 boys is just a bit soft for my liking.  JMO.', '2006-04-01 21:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279021, 312827, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The title of the photo is perfectly matched for the expression on the child''s face.  I think that B&amp;W is a good choice, matching the black vs. white theme of Chess.  I''ve seen this done low key before, but never high key ... I think the high key is a nice match for the youthfulness of the subject.  Exposure appears to be very good!  If I could offer a suggestion,  it would be for stronger focus on the eyes, it looks a bit soft there.  JMO.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The title of the photo is perfectly matched for the expression on the child''s face.  I think that B&W is a good choice, matching the black vs. white theme of Chess.  I''ve seen this done low key before, but never high key ... I think the high key is a nice match for the youthfulness of the subject.  Exposure appears to be very good!  If I could offer a suggestion,  it would be for stronger focus on the eyes, it looks a bit soft there.  JMO.', '2006-04-01 21:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279026, 313159, 49773, '<td valign="top">It looks like a snapshot but i like it.</td>', 'It looks like a snapshot but i like it.', '2006-04-01 21:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279134, 312854, 4551, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. The photo would probably be just as effective without the two gents in the sand. The one fellow looking outward tends to distract more than the other fellow. Nice shot!</td>', 'Great perspective. The photo would probably be just as effective without the two gents in the sand. The one fellow looking outward tends to distract more than the other fellow. Nice shot!', '2006-04-01 22:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279136, 312803, 4551, '<td valign="top">Clever, colorful idea! Nice tonal range and sharpness. Well done!</td>', 'Clever, colorful idea! Nice tonal range and sharpness. Well done!', '2006-04-01 22:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279139, 312502, 4551, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and balanced. I like the way you have kept my eyes in the frame by having the action lok or move to the left. Well done!</td>', 'Nicely composed and balanced. I like the way you have kept my eyes in the frame by having the action lok or move to the left. Well done!', '2006-04-01 22:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279143, 313015, 4551, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of a sloooow shutter speed and flash.</td>', 'Very effective use of a sloooow shutter speed and flash.', '2006-04-01 22:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279145, 312868, 4551, '<td valign="top">Great expressions make this picture. Good tonal range throughout. Well done!</td>', 'Great expressions make this picture. Good tonal range throughout. Well done!', '2006-04-01 22:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2279148, 313267, 4551, '<td valign="top">You have the elements of a great picture here. Too bad Dad got left out of the scene. Perhaps a vertical crop showing Dad aswell would make for a stronger image. Flowers don''t add to the shot but tend to distract. Nice tonal range and beautiful expression.</td>', 'You have the elements of a great picture here. Too bad Dad got left out of the scene. Perhaps a vertical crop showing Dad aswell would make for a stronger image. Flowers don''t add to the shot but tend to distract. Nice tonal range and beautiful expression.', '2006-04-01 22:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
