(2283146, 313268, 35602, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  However, the image is really dark, not much color in the marbles, and the focus needs to be better.  Perhaps some reflected light from a white board placed below the marbles and aiming up, out of camera sight, would have added just that little extra to get a nice sharp image with more color and focus.</td>', 'Good concept.  However, the image is really dark, not much color in the marbles, and the focus needs to be better.  Perhaps some reflected light from a white board placed below the marbles and aiming up, out of camera sight, would have added just that little extra to get a nice sharp image with more color and focus.', '2006-04-03 10:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283151, 313022, 35602, '<td valign="top">Lighting needs work.  The gems in the foreground have little separation bethween them, and they are overexposed which adds to the blending of them.</td>', 'Lighting needs work.  The gems in the foreground have little separation bethween them, and they are overexposed which adds to the blending of them.', '2006-04-03 10:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283154, 310220, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really out of focus.  If you were trying to do a reflection in glass, you need to at least add one element that places this as a reflection and not just a badly focused image.</td>', 'Really out of focus.  If you were trying to do a reflection in glass, you need to at least add one element that places this as a reflection and not just a badly focused image.', '2006-04-03 10:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
