(2287531, 310782, 44540, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot. I really like the composition. The background is muted well and keeps your eyes on the boy. Also the lines (chains) converge on the subject which really makes this work. I think I would rate it higher, though, if it showed his face, perhaps with a big grin.</td>', 'This is a cool shot. I really like the composition. The background is muted well and keeps your eyes on the boy. Also the lines (chains) converge on the subject which really makes this work. I think I would rate it higher, though, if it showed his face, perhaps with a big grin.', '2006-04-04 22:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
