(2291892, 311561, 47117, '<td valign="top">Geez this should have won a top three placement. It is SO unique and nicely done. I gave it a 10.  I can''t even imagine giving this 2''s, 3''s, or 4''s in voting. Just heartbreaking.  VERY NICE photo, and top 10 is nice, but it really should be in top three.</td>', 'Geez this should have won a top three placement. It is SO unique and nicely done. I gave it a 10.  I can''t even imagine giving this 2''s, 3''s, or 4''s in voting. Just heartbreaking.  VERY NICE photo, and top 10 is nice, but it really should be in top three.', '2006-04-06 11:48:04.000000', NULL, 0),
