(2292515, 312688, 15568, '<td valign="top">Many thanks for the comments, especially on the small size of the image.  It was my first posting and I was trying to make sure it didn''t exceed the size requirement which might have gotten it excluded.  But I guess I overcomensated.  Many thanks for the link to the tutorial.<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Bill</td>', 'Many thanks for the comments, especially on the small size of the image.  It was my first posting and I was trying to make sure it didn''t exceed the size requirement which might have gotten it excluded.  But I guess I overcomensated.  Many thanks for the link to the tutorial. Regards,Bill', '2006-04-06 18:11:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2292525, 312853, 37252, '<td valign="top">the only thing in focus here was the face of the man on the right. This is just too bothersome to me not to point out. While your shot was creative, you need to work harder on the technicals.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-06 17:17:05.</i></td>', 'the only thing in focus here was the face of the man on the right. This is just too bothersome to me not to point out. While your shot was creative, you need to work harder on the technicals.', '2006-04-06 18:16:45.000000', '2006-04-06 18:17:05.000000', 0),
(2292633, 310921, 42792, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty Enzo.  The bokeh as you call it really turned this photo into something special.  Congratulations on a most respectable placing!<br/> <br/>Just a thought, out of the challenge context, I think cropping out the lady and orange chair would really make for quite a different effect.  It would become somewhat a play of different "blues". :)</td>', 'This is so pretty Enzo.  The bokeh as you call it really turned this photo into something special.  Congratulations on a most respectable placing! Just a thought, out of the challenge context, I think cropping out the lady and orange chair would really make for quite a different effect.  It would become somewhat a play of different "blues". :)', '2006-04-06 19:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
