(2302985, 313160, 37893, '<td valign="top">IMHO, this didn''t deserve the low score it received. However I can see why it received such a score. First of all, the sky is blwon out. Probably due to a level adjustment or it might be curves. Why can I tell? Look at the brush in the background, it is totally washed out. I think the curves got a little too carried away. As far as the subject is concerned, maybe a show of the face would have been better. It would be nice to see the expression on the face. Kinda like saying, "Hey I''m having fun and I''m loving it".</td>', 'IMHO, this didn''t deserve the low score it received. However I can see why it received such a score. First of all, the sky is blwon out. Probably due to a level adjustment or it might be curves. Why can I tell? Look at the brush in the background, it is totally washed out. I think the curves got a little too carried away. As far as the subject is concerned, maybe a show of the face would have been better. It would be nice to see the expression on the face. Kinda like saying, "Hey I''m having fun and I''m loving it".', '2006-04-11 02:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
