(2684316, 313089, 60862, '<td valign="top">Just stumbled into this.  As someone who''s has both cats and dogs, I think the raw humor of it is pretty good.  That said, guns are bad, so that muted the reaction for me.  Maybe a less topical weapon, like a bow and arrow, or a catapult.<br/> <br/>It would''ve been even funnier if you''d figured out a way to have one of your dogs appearing to own the gun.<br/> <br/>Yeah, that''s it!  Show a dog with one paw about to release a catapult, with a cat in it!  ''Cause that''s subtler.<br/> <br/>LOL.</td>', 'Just stumbled into this.  As someone who''s has both cats and dogs, I think the raw humor of it is pretty good.  That said, guns are bad, so that muted the reaction for me.  Maybe a less topical weapon, like a bow and arrow, or a catapult. It would''ve been even funnier if you''d figured out a way to have one of your dogs appearing to own the gun. Yeah, that''s it!  Show a dog with one paw about to release a catapult, with a cat in it!  ''Cause that''s subtler. LOL.', '2006-08-01 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2743032, 310755, 62095, '<td valign="top">What a clever shot this is. A total reverse on the norm. Makes you wonder what it must be like for thos little guys living in the dolls'' house - or for what it''s like to be the small animals in a zoo with people walking past looking in on you.</td>', 'What a clever shot this is. A total reverse on the norm. Makes you wonder what it must be like for thos little guys living in the dolls'' house - or for what it''s like to be the small animals in a zoo with people walking past looking in on you.', '2006-08-20 05:29:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2743667, 312675, 15575, '<td valign="top">Good exposure/lighting (again!).  My only beef is that you''ve lost the top of her head, which for me kind of kills the shot.  Other than that I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Good exposure/lighting (again!).  My only beef is that you''ve lost the top of her head, which for me kind of kills the shot.  Other than that I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2006-08-20 14:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
